# Cloudflare Pages — routing rules
# Order matters: first match wins.
#
# API endpoints are NOT served by this static deployment. A Pages Function
# (functions/api/[[route]].ts) intercepts every /api/* request and returns a
# clean 404 JSON, so frontend API clients get a proper HTTP error instead of
# this SPA HTML and can fall back gracefully.

# SPA fallback routing — all unmatched client-side routes serve index.html.
